      "description": "Athletic Training Student Worker | Job Details Sign In Create Profile English (US) Athletic Training Student Worker United States | req8773 Apply Now Share Save Job Posted on: 8/19/2026 Back to Search Athletic Training Student Worker Responsibilities: Day-to-day assist secretary with office duties. Assist designated faculty members in research, instruction and professional duties. Assist in the preparation of instructional and laboratory materials prior to each class. Assist faculty members in the collection and analysis of data related to pertinent research studies. Qualifications: Current ESU Student Additional Information: Hourly Rate $11.00 Up to 20 hours per week Employment Eligibility & University Commitment Must be at least 18 years old and have English literacy skills. Employment with ESU is contingent on the selected candidate passing a thorough background check that includes: FBI fingerprinting, PA Child Abuse, and employment/degree verifications. We are proud ESU is an equal-opportunity employer. For more information on President Long's 10-point plan, click here: https://www.esu.edu/president/10-action-plan.cfm Apply Now Share Save Job"
