      "title": "Upward Bound Student Worker",
      "description": "Upward Bound Student Worker | Job Details Sign In Create Profile English (US) Upward Bound Student Worker United States | req8730 Apply Now Share Save Job Posted on: 7/15/2026 Back to Search Upward Bound Student Worker East Stroudsburg University’s Upward Bound\ndepartment currently seeks a dynamic team member to serve as an office\nwork/study student during the academic year. Job qualifications include: Must be enrolled as a full-time ESU student. Must have knowledge or experience of Upward Bound / TRIO programs. Ability to assist students and their families via email, social media and telephone. Effective clerical, time management and organizational skills. Dependable and professional. Ability to multitask. Ability to work with a diverse group of people who share the vision of Upward Bound’s mission. Additional Information: Up to work ten hours per week, including operational Saturdays. $10.00 hourly rate Employment Eligibility & University Commitment Employment with ESU is contingent on the selected candidate passing a thorough background check that includes: FBI fingerprinting, PA Child Abuse, and employment/degree verifications. We are proud ESU is an equal-opportunity employer. For more information on President Long's 10-point plan, click here: https://www.esu.edu/president/10-action-plan.cfm Apply Now Share Save Job"
